---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy · Cuban Salsa Calendar" description="What Cuban Salsa Calendar stores, which partners we link to, and when they may set cookies.">
  <div class="topbar">
    <a class="topbar__back" href="/">← All festivals</a>
  </div>
  <div class="page-head">
    <span class="kicker">Updated October 2026</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2 class="h2">The short version</h2>
    <p>We don't have accounts, we don't run ads and we don't use tracking or analytics cookies. The site is free. To keep it that way, some links to flights and places to stay are affiliate links: if you book through them, the partner pays us a small commission. The price is the same for you.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">What stays on your device</h2>
    <p>Your saved festivals, recent searches, the city you chose for travel times and your light or dark setting are kept in your own browser (local storage). They never reach us. "Nearest to me" asks your browser for your location only when you choose it, and keeps it in memory until you leave the page.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">Affiliate partners</h2>
    <p>"Find flights" links go through <a href="https://www.travelpayouts.com/" rel="noopener">Travelpayouts</a> to <a href="https://www.kiwi.com/" rel="noopener">Kiwi.com</a>. "Find a place to stay" links go to <a href="https://www.stay22.com/" rel="noopener">Stay22</a>, which shows offers from booking sites. These partners may set cookies when you click their links, or when one of their scripts loads on our pages, so they can credit the booking to us. Their own privacy policies apply on their sites.</p>
    <p>"Get passes" links go straight to the organizer or their ticket shop.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">Other services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The site is hosted by Cloudflare, which processes basic request data (such as your IP address) to deliver pages and keep the site safe.</li>
      <li>Maps load tiles from <a href="https://openfreemap.org/" rel="noopener">OpenFreeMap</a> when you open one.</li>
      <li>The submit and correction forms use Cloudflare Turnstile to block spam. What you send in a form becomes a ticket in our private review queue.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h2">Questions</h2>
    <p>Write to us on Instagram at <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cubansalsacalendar" rel="noopener">@cubansalsacalendar</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
